<section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">{{ 'testimonials.title' | t }}</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">{{ 'testimonials.subtitle' | t }}</p>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"用了两周，头皮出油明显少了，以前上午洗下午就塌，现在能撑一整天。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>张女士</strong>
            <span>{{ 'testimonials.item1_tag' | t }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"头屑困扰好几年了，这块皂洗了半个月头屑少了很多，肩膀终于干净了。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>李先生</strong>
            <span>{{ 'testimonials.item2_tag' | t }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"怀孕后头皮变得敏感，这款皂没有香精味，洗着很安心，不刺激。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>王女士</strong>
            <span>{{ 'testimonials.item3_tag' | t }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Testimonials" }]
}
{% endschema %}